    "sub_ename": "NONDESTRUCTIVE TESTING",
    "describe_ch": "本課程將非破壞檢測中常用的檢測方法作完整性的介紹，課程包括非破壞檢測應用範圍、目視檢測法、液滲檢測法、超音波檢測法及磁粒檢測法、放射線檢測法等。",
    "describe_eh": "This course has a complete coverage of common testing methods of steel structure, including nondestructive testing and its applications, visual testing, liquid penetrate testing, ultrasonic testing and Magnetic testing methods.",
